{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98701","id":2156486853,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6AiWDF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98701","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98701.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98701.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98701","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98701/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98701/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98701/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5216ef5f9cb9479989b58aaab797a87a61899630","number":98701,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add dependency detection improvements to the render graph.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Improvements\r\n\r\n* Buffers changing their usage are no longer treated as write usage unless the API requires it. This was originally introduced because textures changing their usage usually implies a layout change, but that is not true for buffers depending on how the API treats them.\r\n  * D3D12 usually requires state transitions, but that is not true if enhanced barriers are used instead.\r\n* Draw lists are not treated as being dependent on each other if their regions do not intersect despite both being write commands.\r\n* `CopyEffects::copy_cubemap_to_dp` was edited to use the viewport and scissor instead of embedding the screen rectangle into the push constant. This allows the render graph to detect whether draw lists overlap or not.\r\n\r\n### Results\r\n\r\nOn the reference scene, [TPS demo from here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90284), the render graph goes down from 22 levels to 17 levels, thanks to the shadow passes on cubemaps for omni lights being merged together to be able to draw to all six faces without having to insert a synchronization barrier. Future improvements might be possible by changing the rendering code further.\r\n\r\nOn my Mali-G78 I've measured a consistent reduction of ~31 ms down to ~30 ms in GPU time (proper profiling is pending until I acquire hardware that is capable of working with the Mali profiler). I've been unable to spot any significant difference on the RTX 3090 Ti on desktop.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3554c76-5c59-4dd1-963e-553557bc158b)\r\n\r\nI haven't seen any errors introduced by this change and tested with the validation layer to make sure of that. That said, testing is appreciated.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nContributed by [W4 Games](https://w4games.com/). 🍀\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-10-31T15:15:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T